<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-HudCon calls on Packer to sell shares.</title>
<headline>RTRS-HudCon calls on Packer to sell shares.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hudson Conway Ltd chief executive Lloyd Williams called on Australian's richest man Kerry Packer on Thursday to sell the remaining 50 million shares he owns in the Melbourne-based property and investment group.</p>
</text>
